</span></li>
<li about="#cite_note-Turner-2" id="cite_note-Turner-2" data-mw-footnote-number="2"><span class="mw-cite-backlink" id="mwmA"><a href="#cite_ref-Turner_2-0" rel="mw:referencedBy" id="mwmQ"><span class="mw-linkback-text" id="mwmg">↑</span></a></span> <span id="mw-reference-text-cite_note-Turner-2" class="mw-reference-text reference-text">Turner, J., <i id="mwmw">New directions in communications (or which way to the information age?)</i>. IEEE Communications Magazine 24 (10): 8–15. <link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1333433106" about="#mwt23" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles" id="mwnA" data-mw='{"name":"templatestyles","attrs":{"src":"Module:Citation/CS1/styles.css"},"body":{"extsrc":""}}'/><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/ISSN_(identifier)" title="ISSN (identifier)" class="mw-redirect" id="mwnQ">ISSN</a><span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwng"> </span><a rel="mw:ExtLink nofollow" href="https://search.worldcat.org/issn/0163-6804" class="external text" id="mwnw">0163-6804</a>, 1986.</span></li>
<li about="#cite_note-Tanenbaum-lbaq-3" id="cite_note-Tanenbaum-lbaq-3" data-mw-footnote-number="3"><span rel="mw:referencedBy" class="mw-cite-backlink" id="mwoA"><a href="#cite_ref-Tanenbaum-lbaq_3-0" id="mwoQ"><span class="mw-linkback-text" id="mwog">1</span></a> <a href="#cite_ref-Tanenbaum-lbaq_3-1" id="mwow"><span class="mw-linkback-text" id="mwpA">2</span></a></span> <span id="mw-reference-text-cite_note-Tanenbaum-lbaq-3" class="mw-reference-text reference-text">Andrew S. Tanenbaum, <i id="mwpQ">Computer Networks, Fourth Edition</i>, <link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1333433106" about="#mwt28" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles" id="mwpg" data-mw='{"name":"templatestyles","attrs":{"src":"Module:Citation/CS1/styles.css"},"body":{"extsrc":""}}'/><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/ISBN_(identifier)" title="ISBN (identifier)" class="mw-redirect" id="mwpw">ISBN</a><span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwqA"> </span><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Special:BookSources/0-13-166836-6" title="Special:BookSources/0-13-166836-6" id="mwqQ"><bdi id="mwqg">0-13-166836-6</bdi></a>, Prentice Hall PTR, 2003., page 401.</span></li>
